WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:02.701
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.503
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.304
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.838
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.740
Happy New Year, everyone!

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.510
Tonight is our first show
of 2023.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:14.080
It was going to be yesterday,
but I was on Southwest, so.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.081
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.081 --> 00:00:18.617
The House held it's vote today
to elect a new speaker

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.554
and went to multiple ballots
for the first time in 100 years.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.557
It's the moment every member
of Congress fears --

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.459
having to work longer hours.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.261
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.063
President Biden is set tomorrow
to promote

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:33.232
the bipartisan infrastructure
bill at an event in Kentucky

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.967
with Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.837
That's right, America's
crumbling infrastructure

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:41.474
is going to promote the
bipartisan infrastructure bill.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.510
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.712
The CDC is warning
that a new variant

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.680
of the Omicron strain
of coronavirus

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.682
has nearly doubled
over the past week,

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.951
so, it looks like COVID
is the only thing

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.888
that's actually doing
new year, new me.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.057
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.893
Republicans took control today
of the House of Representatives

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.428
for the first time
in four years.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:05.265
Well, the first
legal time in four years.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.433
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.902
George Santos was sworn in today
as a member

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.038
of the House of Representatives
in the state of New York

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:14.039
and, not as he
originally claimed,

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:15.108
Pandora.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.243
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:19.879
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:20.980
We had a moment backstage.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.114
We were like,
"Do we think everybody's

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:23.783
up to speed on the
George Santos story?"

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.785
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.252
Been two weeks.
Everybody's with family.

00:01:27.252 --> 00:01:30.123
They're not going to be reading
the news every day.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.157
And now we know.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.592
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.327
Did you guys know "Avatar"
came out?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.597
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:40.066
Former President Trump
was reportedly DJing

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.335
on his iPad
at Mar-A-Lago last week...

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:43.503
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:46.372
and played Celine Dion's
"My Heart Will Go On."

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.608
[ Laughter ]
Wow, the guy definitely knows

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.043
how to get a party started.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.077
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.178
What'd he play at midnight,

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.347
"Everybody Hurts" by R.E.M.?

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:55.481
[ Laughter ]
[ As Trump ] Of course,

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.283
no one hurts more than I do.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.485
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.320
That's right,
Trump was DJing on his iPad

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.755
last week at Mar-A-Lago

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.491
and I think the legal bills
are piling up for him

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:08.494
because every song was followed
by a Spotify ad.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:11.430
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.933
[ As Trump ]
Just a few quick words
for my friends at Spotify.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:17.770
According
to newly released testimony,

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.939
former First Lady Melania Trump
was upset

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.776
that Rudy Giuliani was allowed
inside the White House residence

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.579
and was worried about him seeing
her wearing a bathrobe.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:30.315
Or, 1,000 times more likely,

00:02:30.315 --> 00:02:31.851
her seeing him in one.

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:34.420
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.456
New York state's first licensed
marijuana store opened last week

00:02:37.456 --> 00:02:39.225
in Manhattan at 4:20 pm

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.993
and it must be good weed

00:02:40.993 --> 00:02:43.730
because it was supposed to open
at 10:00 am.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.031
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:50.336
Finally, yesterday was
National 55 mph Speed Limit Day,

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.171
or, as it's called
in New Jersey,

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:53.706
the texting lane.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.307
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:57.843
That was the monologue,
everybody. We're off!

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:58.811
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:58.811 --> 00:02:59.779
It's a new year!

